# Line endings: every text file is LF in the repo and in the working tree (agents and editors on
# Windows agree; no LF->CRLF warnings on commit). Binary types are listed so they are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
